This card holder can hold your French ID card (the big one, not the CB one), a driver's license, 4 cards to be placed in the inside right slots, 1 to 4 cards in the left slot, and several cards in the left sub-pocket (about 6 or more)

This handmade wallet is from an original template designed to order for a specific use.

[The leather](notion:b82a8bf9ee1040e0816e7a0581027cbd) used named Pueblo has a marbled aspect that gives it a classy, grunge and unique visual. I use here the colors Tabacco and Cognac in combination.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

